+## Native parametric review — review-64519201510b2909
+
+Built the task-local `finish` family under `workspace/parametric/` without
+changing the production generator or canonical authority. `translate_only`
+returns the byte-exact canonical program
+(`6dc047f6d5665a74ecdc862875ecc605e91210827d6803d542bea74c0360183d`).
+`largest_visible_fragment` first applies the exact marker-vector translation
+with clipping, then recomputes visible color-8 four-connected fragments and
+recolors the unique largest fragment yellow. The connected U-shaped source
+splits into two unequal candidates only when its translated bridge is clipped,
+so stage B cannot select its object before stage A.
+
+The sampler supports 2–6 demonstrations, 1–4 prefix-stable private queries,
+matched inputs across settings, four distinct queries, and a substantive 30×30
+case with at least 40 source cells. The reusable `audit.py` checked 320 episodes,
+2,560 labeled pairs, 1,280 public turns and 60 protected-Racket evaluations; no
+declared shortcut survived. Native qualification covered both settings at seeds
+0 and 17 with 40 Racket labels. The official wrong-order witness replayed and
+changed five cells.
